ace="+mj-lt"/></a:rPr><a:t>Frontier Accelerate for Copilot: Envisioning &amp; POC </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>engagement, we recommend delivering an </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"><a:latin typeface="+mj-lt"/></a:rPr><a:t>executive summary</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t> presentation—ideally attended by business sponsors, IT, and key stakeholders. You may share the executive summary and any other deliverables with the customer at this time.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Suggested agenda:</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>Review the scope, goals, and discuss the engagement output.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>Present recommendations to the customer, framing the results in terms of strategic alignment and value of the initiatives identified during the engagement.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>Identify and review any additional recommendations and next steps.  </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>Gather feedback on how the engagement was delivered.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="7" name="TextBox 6"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{F725E229-A230-DC1E-47B5-9352374E42BA}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="4794249" y="4452780"/><a:ext cx="6636739" cy="1753672"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="roundRect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg2"/></a:solidFill></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="182880" tIns="182880" rIns="182880" bIns="182880"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr